Demings is sort of beneath him.

00:00:51.910 --> 00:00:58.180
Why does he have to waste his time as the
incumbent senator debating this lowly other

00:00:58.180 --> 00:00:59.450
individual?

00:00:59.450 --> 00:01:01.059
And she really crushed him now.

00:01:01.059 --> 00:01:03.960
